<BaseLayout title="Advertising — BoyKingTut.com">
<main class="detail-page">
<section class="detail-hero"><img src="/images/card-affiliate.jpg" alt="Bring Traffic to Local Business"/><div class="detail-hero-copy"><p class="card-kicker">LOCAL ADVERTISING</p><h1>Bring Traffic to Local Business</h1><p>Structured local promotion for independent businesses.</p></div></section>

<section class="page-section"><h2>Packages</h2><div class="pricing-grid"><article class="price-card"><strong>$250</strong><b>Local — 15 Miles</b><small>Monthly</small><a class="gold-cta" href="/checkout?product=local_basic">START</a></article><article class="price-card"><strong>$399</strong><b>Local Plus — Up to 50 Miles</b><small>Monthly · brochure design where applicable</small><a class="gold-cta" href="/checkout?product=local_plus">START</a></article><article class="price-card"><strong>$500</strong><b>Expanded</b><small>Monthly</small><a class="gold-cta" href="/checkout?product=local_max">START</a></article></div></section>
<section class="page-section"><h2>How It Works</h2><div class="steps-list"><article><div><h3>Request business material</h3><p>Ask the business for a current brochure, menu, price list or service sheet.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Upload the current image</h3><p>Use up-to-date material and confirm pricing/offers with the owner.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Select target area</h3><p>U.S.: ZIP code and radius. International: city and country, with postal area when useful.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Choose package and pay</h3><p>The client chooses a plan and pays through the Solana checkout.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Monitor progress</h3><p>Account and affiliate dashboards show subscription status, referrals and notes.</p></div></article></div><div class="notice-box">Advertising performance varies by market, location, offer, competition and season. No specific number of customers or revenue is guaranteed.</div></section>

</main></BaseLayout>
